      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2036855653,
      "version": 336,
      "versionNonce": 1608214731,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790351389625,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is \"system\" -- the thing you and your team are building.\n- An api makes it's functionality available to other through the HTTP\n   endpoints. System tests test these.\n- In UI (e.g. Angular) - The user interacts with the app directly\n     - buttons, forms, links, etc.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is \"system\" -- the thing you and your team are building.\n- An api makes it's functionality available to other through the HTTP\n   endpoints. System tests test these.\n- In UI (e.g. Angular) - The user interacts with the app directly\n     - buttons, forms, links, etc.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JQRo995V-s2lkzxBZnVPv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 575,
      "y": -135,
      "width": 723.7394409179688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1736252325,
      "version": 109,
      "versionNonce": 1238626341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790351357699,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We test to get confidence. That's it. We can't prove anything with tests,\nbut we can gain confidence.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We test to get confidence. That's it. We can't prove anything with tests,\nbut we can gain confidence.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "96dblWPgFdn0e16rQG-vs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 359,
      "y": 103,
      "width": 1092.6793212890625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1382959141,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 1023251819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790351668577,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Unit Integration - sometimes there are technical requirements that can't be tested through the system test.\nUnit tests - should be testing complex logic, algorithms, etc. Just so you can flood them with lots of examples.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Unit Integration - sometimes there are technical requirements that can't be tested through the system test.\nUnit tests - should be testing complex logic, algorithms, etc. Just so you can flood them with lots of examples.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
